{"name":"Mimimarked","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"evil","hitDice":"5","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":5,"otherArmorDesc":"9","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"17 (5d8 - 5)","speedDesc":"10m","strPoints":"10","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"8","intPoints":"12","wisPoints":"4","chaPoints":"6","blindsight":"60","blind":true,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1/8","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Mimicry","desc":"The [MON] can mimic 3 sounds it has heard. A creature that hears the sounds can tell they are imitations with a successful DC 15 Wisdom (Insight) check."},{"name":"Poisoned Touch","desc":"Whenever the [MON] hits a creature, it can inflict poison ([INT ATK] to hit, cd 10). The target takes [INT 1D4] poison damage on its next turn."}],"actions":[{"name":"Dagger","desc":"_Melee or Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, reach 1m or range 6/8m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage."},{"name":"Shortsword","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D6] piercing damage."},{"name":"Light Crossbow","desc":"_Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [DEX ATK] to hit, range 24/97m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D8] piercing damage."},{"name":"Warhammer","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 1m, one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D8] bludgeoning damage, or [STR 1D10] bludgeoning damage if used with two hands."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"poison","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[{"name":"heal (x4)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"radiant (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[{"name":"blinded"},{"name":"deafened"},{"name":"poisoned"},{"name":"stunned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Common","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}